      "GroupDto": {
        "GroupName": "CPNX",
        "Description": "copy gate (input A, threshold 0.375): the inverted-address fan-out onto the word-0 enable EN0 and the word-0 read cascade CPN. The whole RAM composes at the logic layer, not optically: every gate\u0027s truth table is extracted once in isolation, so each stage restores clean 0/1 levels by construction \u2014 there is deliberately no multi-stage passive optical cascade here.",
